{"title":"2022 SSMO Team Round Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8aeaa8a74c8fe8e5b89b7dfff5e8cbdd2996402a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> satisfy \\begin{align*} a^2+b^2&amp;=1,\\\\ x^2+y^2&amp;=1,\\quad\\text{and}\\\\ abxy-\\frac{1}{8}&amp;=b^2y^2. \\end{align*} find the sum of all distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/56705b0a2a901109dadfc8eb37586a43fef4430a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+x+y)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/950af58ede7536890d21acdf038ccff859eed45d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(\\cos\\alpha,\\sin\\alpha)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"164\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789c84c7aeb34ee8de59e9343dd61116540f29b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)=(\\cos\\beta,\\sin\\beta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"20\" />. We have  \\begin{align*} abxy-\\frac{1}{8}&amp;=b^2y^2\\\\ by(ax-by)&amp;=\\frac{1}{8}\\\\ \\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta(\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta-\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta)&amp;=\\frac{1}{8}\\\\ \\left(\\frac{\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)}{2}\\right)\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)&amp;=\\frac{1}{8}. \\end{align*} Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c56f548e2beaa78a350ac2aba80a9c486f9a310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" /> be fixed The left hand side is maximized when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f87fd515eb48a07139dd44384b1d157e4c7b1bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=\\pm1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />, depending on the sign of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc4d288196e5c1f54f936e7b7d2be892c9704f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f68a147287add0c61bfa107169712b5e4eacbcf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)\\right)\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)\\le\\left(\\pm1-t\\right)t=-\\left(t\\pm\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\frac{1}{4}\\le \\frac{1}{4}.\\]\" width=\"558\" height=\"43\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80df998895c0ffef29cba87efa722a263490059.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)-\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)\\right)\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\frac{1}{8},\\]\" width=\"330\" height=\"37\" /> we must have an equality case in the inquality above. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/5/ec5d938350d90a7637aa5734f9a3e0cc5a91b5d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"37\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aa973d396b1328883e8dbb3b0526d9ed833d3b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=\\frac{1}{2}\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=1,\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"37\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d6d113a728d368a7076ca8ace14fec83796ab3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha,\\beta)=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6},\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right),\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{6},\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"224\" height=\"45\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22bad15662820c30824b2f9667913ccf4a38bb50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+x+y=\\sqrt{3}\\pm1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"23\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/8048f3a00fc500e989c982f82bd65c51fe7651b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"60\" height=\"38\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d267e80ccc53fb515fed702025a71109eb94cd01.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\cos(\\alpha+\\beta)=-\\frac{1}{2}\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)=-1,\\]\" width=\"332\" height=\"37\" /> giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97c09fa68c4bf8118033a9d77d234039c0744956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha,\\beta)=\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{6},\\frac{11\\pi}{6}\\right),\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6},\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"247\" height=\"45\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e7789aa83744b363d4c5b9e63e58aa2242fa7714.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+x+y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />. Then sum of all distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/56705b0a2a901109dadfc8eb37586a43fef4430a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b+x+y)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"21\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db751c0f9ea3e8a9a7eb3929a1fa081837fd9448.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+\\sqrt{3})^2+(1-\\sqrt{3})^2+0^2=\\boxed{8}.\\]\" width=\"262\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017064633\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3967/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26209:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017064633 and revision id 280169. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}